  "description": "A local Model Context Protocol server that lets coding agents load C# projects and run C# queries over the Metalama code model and introspection API. It speaks MCP only over stdio. Results in the html format are served to the user's browser on https://localhost, on a random port, behind a secret token; that server runs only the queries that the user edits in its pages.",
